# BAWAAL Sport Hub Map (LOCKED)

`SportHubMapScreen` + dark map style + Virar sports spots are **production-final**. Do **not** restyle labels, reshape filter pills, or replace the spots database unless the user explicitly unlocks this rule.

## Locked files (do not edit)

- `SportHubMapScreen.js` — map surface, Markers, footer category pills, sheet
- `src/constants/darkMapStyle.js` — `BAWAAL_DARK_MAP_STYLE` (`customMapStyle`)
- `src/data/sportHubs.js` — `VIRAR_SPORTS_SPOTS`, `filterVirarSportsSpots`, hub pin colors, Virar region

## Locked map chrome (`BAWAAL_DARK_MAP_STYLE`)

| Element | Color / rule |
|---|---|
| Canvas / geometry | Pitch-black / near-black (`#0a0a0a`) |
| Road lines | Clean white `#FFFFFF` |
| Road name labels | Electric Orange `#FF6600` |
| Administrative / locality labels | Bright Cyan `#00F0FF` |
| POI / minor place labels | Warm Gold `#FFE082` |
| **All** `labels.text.stroke` | Solid black `#000000`, **weight 4** (heavy halo) |
| Business POIs + transit | Hidden |

Do not mute labels, drop stroke weight below 4, or recolor roads away from white / orange.

## Category filter → Markers (LOCKED)

- Footer pills update `selectedCategory` (ALL, SPORTS SPOTS, GYM, FOOTBALL, CRICKET, KABADDI, COMBAT, …).
- Markers render from `filterVirarSportsSpots(selectedCategory)` only — glowing category badges via `HubPin` / `HUB_SPORT_COLORS`.
- Remount keys include `selectedCategory` so pins refresh on pill tap.
- Camera snaps to `SPORT_HUB_MAP_REGION` (Virar) on filter change.
- Do not swap Virar spots for metro hub lists or invent local sport label arrays.

## Allowed elsewhere

- New features outside this map stack
- Critical crash/security fixes that must touch these files: ask the user first and preserve this visual/filter contract
